  "description": "The man known as General within a villainous organization that plans to take over the world is usually fighting to the death against the Rangers who protect the Earth...<br>\n<br>\nBut today is his day off.<br>\n<br>\nTo heal his tired soul from working so hard every day, he goes to the zoo to see pandas and to the convenience store to get some ice cream.<br>\n<br>\nWe get to see how a certain villain gets to completely enjoy his days off to the fullest in this comedy that will heal your soul.<br>\n<br>\n(Source: Crunchyroll)",
